      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "louis",
      "t": "Это будет очень смешно.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go back through the exchange around Idiot line by line and unpack how the Russian works.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Тут все по-французски.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Here everything is in French.' Elena points out a potential issue. She notices that the entire recipe is in French.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Для нашего шефа это не проблема.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'For our chef this is not a problem.' She quickly dismisses the concern. Elena confidently states this is not a problem for their chef.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Правда, Максимилиан?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Right, Maximilian?' Elena asks Max for confirmation. She prompts him to agree with her.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Си.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Si.' Max gives a confident but incorrect answer. He replies with the Italian word for yes.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "louis",
      "t": "Си? Идиот.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Si? Idiot.' Louis mutters an insult under his breath. He calls Max an idiot for the mistake.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "louis",
      "t": "Си — это по-итальянски.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Si is in Italian.' Louis corrects the language error privately. He points out that 'si' is Italian.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "louis",
      "t": "По-французски будет уи.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In French it will be oui.' He provides the correct French translation. Louis notes that it should be 'oui'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Да, конечно, я знаю это.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, of course, I know this.' Max tries to cover his tracks. He quickly agrees and claims he knew that all along.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Максимилиан, вы понимаете французский язык?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Maximilian, do you understand the French language?' Elena is slightly suspicious now. She directly asks if he understands the French language.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Конечно, я прекрасно понимаю французский.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Of course, I understand French perfectly.' Max doubles down on his lie. He confidently asserts that he understands French perfectly.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "louis",
      "t": "Ну, что ты будешь делать теперь?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, what will you do now?' Louis watches with amusement. He wonders aloud how Max is going to get out of this one.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Я прочитаю этот рецепт и приготовлю блюдо.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will read this recipe and prepare the dish.' Max announces his plan to the room. He says he will read the recipe and cook the dish.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "louis",
      "t": "Это будет очень смешно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
